    <script type="application/ld+json"> {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "NewsArticle",
    "headline": "YEN\u0130 Parti kongresinde Erden K\u00f6yba\u015f\u0131 partinin ilk il ba\u015fkan\u0131 oldu",
    "name": "YEN\u0130 Parti kongresinde Erden K\u00f6yba\u015f\u0131 partinin ilk il ba\u015fkan\u0131 oldu",
    "inLanguage": "tr",
    "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://www.korfezdehaber.com/yeni-parti-kongresinde-erden-koybasi-partinin-ilk-il-baskani-oldu/135997"
    },
    "publisher": {
        "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
        "name": "K\u00f6rfezde Haber",
        "logo": {
            "@type": "ImageObject",
            "url": "https://www.korfezdehaber.com/images/generals/logo.png",
            "width": 240,
            "height": 60
        }
    },
    "datePublished": "2026-10-25T18:25:00+03:00",
    "dateModified": "2026-10-25T18:30:00+03:00",
    "description": "YEN\u0130 Parti kongresinde Erden K\u00f6yba\u015f\u0131 partinin ilk il ba\u015fkan\u0131 oldu",
    "articleBody": "\u00a0\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti Bal\u0131kesir 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi\u2019nde kurucu il ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erden K\u00f6yba\u015f\u0131,se\u00e7ilmi\u015f ilk il ba\u015fkan\u0131 oldu.\r\n\r\nBal\u0131kesir\u2019de te\u015fkilatlanma \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00fcrd\u00fcren YEN\u0130 Parti, 1. Ola\u011fan \u0130l Kongresi\u2019ni G\u00fcndo\u011fan Mahallesi\u2019ndeki Alt\u0131eyl\u00fcl Belediyesi ALGEM toplant\u0131 salonunda ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirdi. Kongreye partililer, delegeler ve davetliler kat\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\nKongrede, Edremit Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mehmet Erta\u015f, il\u00e7e ba\u015fkan\u0131 Emin Yal\u00e7\u0131nta\u015f ve \u00fcyeler delegelerle bir araya gelerek oy kulland\u0131.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nManisa Milletvekili Ahmet Vehbi Bak\u0131ro\u011flu\u2019nun divan ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 kongrede, ge\u00e7ti\u011fimiz hafta ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen \u00f6n se\u00e7imde \u00fcyelerin oylar\u0131yla belirlenen Erden K\u00f6yba\u015f\u0131 ve listesi g\u00fcven tazeleyerek yeniden il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na se\u00e7ildi. Kongrede ayr\u0131ca 32 ki\u015filik il y\u00f6netim kurulu, 9 ki\u015filik disiplin kurulu ve 18 ki\u015filik kurultay delegesi belirlendi. K\u00f6yba\u015f\u0131, kongrede 80 g\u00fcnl\u00fck s\u00fcre\u00e7te \u00fcye say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n 20 bini a\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131na dikkat \u00e7ekti.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nErta\u015f\u2019a kongre boyunca g\u00f6sterilen yo\u011fun ilgi ise dikkat \u00e7ekti. Edremit Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mehmet Erta\u015f, Erden K\u00f6yba\u015f\u0131 ve y\u00f6netim kurulunu tebrik ederek kongrenin partiye ve Bal\u0131kesir\u2019e hay\u0131rl\u0131 olmas\u0131n\u0131 diledi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nErta\u015f, Bal\u0131kesir\u2019de dayan\u0131\u015fma ve kararl\u0131l\u0131kla \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam edeceklerini belirterek, partiyi iktidara ta\u015f\u0131ma hedefi do\u011frultusunda m\u00fccadelelerini s\u00fcrd\u00fcreceklerini ifade etti.\r\n\r\n",
